    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When 'I' woke up in a corner of the devastated world, my body had been turned into a machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have no memories and do not even know my sex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setsu, a girl from a ninja clan, appeared before me,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She told me that my face was identical to that of my twin brother and sister who had just disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Am I really the 'hero' brother or the 'murderer' sister? ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find out the truth, I enter a city ruled by a clan of ninjas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Outline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Visual novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time: about 100 minutes </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When 'I' woke up in a corner of the devastated world, my body had been turned into a machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I have no memories and do not even know my sex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Setsu, a girl from a ninja clan, appeared before me,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She told me that my face was identical to that of my twin brother and sister who had just disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Am I really the 'hero' brother or the 'murderer' sister? ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find out the truth, I enter a city ruled by a clan of ninjas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Outline</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre: Visual novel </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play time: about 100 minutes </p>",
    "short_description": "In that world, simply being alive was enough to bear the weight of sin. To prevent the depletion of energy that grants supernatural powers, those who fail to prove their &quot;worth of existence&quot; are eliminated. \u2026In this desolate world, I awoke with no memories, not even knowing my own name.",
